ure), TCPTransport's TLS and configuration wiring, and InmemTransport's in-process delivery and ordering semantics, with the note that inmem_transport.go is the transport the captured tests exercise and therefore underpins the harness evidence rather than being library-external. Preflight validation returns valid with no diagnostics.\"}"}}
